  "privacyPlaceholderBody": "This page is a placeholder. A legally binding privacy policy does not exist yet. No information about controllers or processing purposes is stated here on purpose.",
  "privacyMailTitle": "Student email",
  "privacyMailBody": "When you use the student email feature, the app connects directly and encrypted to the Hochschule Anhalt mail server (mail.hs-anhalt.de). There is no intermediary server: neither this app's servers nor third parties receive your credentials or your emails. Your email address and password are stored only in your device's secure keystore. Message contents are loaded only for display and are not stored permanently in the app. Using \"Remove account\" deletes your email address and password from the device completely.",
  "privacyGradesTitle": "Grades",
  "privacyGradesBody": "When you use the grades feature, the app connects directly and encrypted to Hochschule Anhalt's HIS-QIS exam portal (service.ssc.hs-anhalt.de). There is no intermediary server: neither this app's servers nor third parties receive your credentials or your grades. Your username and password are stored only in your device's secure keystore; grades are cached locally, encrypted with a device-held key. An automatic fetch happens at most once every 24 hours, plus manually on request. Using \"Delete credentials and local grades\" removes your credentials, grades and the encryption key from the device completely.",
